WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.461 --> 00:00:10.716
Client Estimates is how you price the job for your client.

2
00:00:10.717 --> 00:00:17.696
Each estimate shows its status, the contract value, cost to date and your margin, with GST.

3
00:00:17.696 --> 00:00:28.410
Press New Estimate to make one. Set how long it's valid, the tax rate, and any notes for the client.
